# Tracked in the PUBLIC nyzn/dotfiles repo — whitelist only.
# Everything else under ~/.claude (credentials, transcripts, session state,
# caches, plugin installs) must stay untracked. Add new entries deliberately.
#
# Every rule is anchored with a leading "/". An unanchored "!README.md" would
# match at ANY depth and drag in the whole plugins/ cache.
*
!*/
/plugins/
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/settings.json
!/agents/**
!/hooks/**
!/skills/**
